Description: Test-fixture prox_mpc::Model plugins for the ProxMPC stack.
 These models exercise controller paths the bundled production models cannot reach (for example a non-finite command, or an asymmetric bound). Not for production use. Fixture class names are not a stable interface and may change without notice.
